### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Register (expect 201 + token, second run: 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "John Doe", "email": "john@example.com", "password": "password123"}

### Register with invalid data - name (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "email": "abc", "password": "123"}

### Login (expect 200 + token)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "John@Example.com", "password": "password123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Login with wrong password (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "john@example.com", "password": "wrong-password"}

### Login with unknown email (expect 401, same message)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "nobody@example.com", "password": "password123"}

### Logout (expect 204)
POST http://localhost:8080/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout again with the same token (expect 401, token is already revoked)
POST http://localhost:8080/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout without token (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/logout

### Create book (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": " The Pragmatic Programmer ", "description": "Tips for becoming a better developer", "tags": ["Tech", "must-read", "tech"]}

### Create book without token (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "No token"}

### Create book with invalid data (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "", "tags": "tech"}

### Seed: book with coding tag
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Clean Code", "description": "A handbook of agile software craftsmanship", "tags": ["coding", "tech"]}

### Seed: another coding book
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Refactoring", "description": "Improving the design of existing code", "tags": ["Coding", "must-read"]}

### Seed: fiction book
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "The Hobbit", "description": "A fantasy adventure", "tags": ["fiction", "weekend"]}

### Seed: book with tag containing a space
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Dune", "tags": ["fiction", "book club"]}

### Seed: book without tags
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Atomic Habits", "description": "Small changes, remarkable results"}

### List books (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List page 2 with limit 1 (expect 200, 1 book, total unchanged)
GET http://localhost:8080/books?page=2&limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by tag (expect only books tagged "coding")
GET http://localhost:8080/books?tag=Coding
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid limit (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/books?limit=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List without token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/books